flowchart TD
    subgraph Stakeholders [Users & Stakeholders]
        BA[Business Analyst]
        SME[Subject Matter Expert / Staff]
        MGR[Management / Process Owner]
    end

    subgraph Presentation [Interface Layer]
        Chat[Chat Interface\nSlack / Web Portal]
        Dash[Dashboard View]
    end

    subgraph AgentSystem [Workflow Discovery AI Agent]
        Engine[Stateful Interview Engine]
        Rules[Policy Enforcer\nNo-Interpolation & Solutioning Flags]
        KB[(Versioned Knowledge Base)]
    end

    subgraph Enterprise [Enterprise Systems]
        Repo[(Existing Documentation Repository)]
    end

    %% 1. Initialization
    BA -->|"Seeds foundational concepts"| Chat
    Chat -->|"Initial parameters"| Engine
    Repo -->|"Pulls foundational policy data"| Engine

    %% 2. Interview Loop
    Engine -->|"Iterative discovery questions"| Chat
    Chat -->|"Prompts & clarification requests"| SME
    SME -->|"Operational reality & feedback"| Chat
    Chat -->|"Transcripts & inputs"| Engine

    %% 3. Policy & Conflict Enforcement
    Engine <-->|"Cross-references inputs"| Rules
    Rules -->|"Flags solutioning & process conflicts"| Chat

    %% 4. Validation & Storage
    Engine -->|"Draft summary for review"| Chat
    SME -->|"Timestamped approval & validation"| Chat
    Chat -->|"Committed validated data"| KB

    %% 5. Output & Reporting
    KB -->|"Consolidated workflow data"| Engine
    Engine -->|"Visual process maps & structured reports"| Dash
    Engine -->|"Pushes final maps & reports"| Repo

    %% 6. Consumption
    Dash -->|"Reviews maps & unresolved friction"| MGR
    Dash -->|"Accesses 'To BA's Attention' section"| BA